{"id":5623,"date":"2025-09-07T12:00:14","date_gmt":"2025-09-07T05:00:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5623"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:28:20","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:28:20","slug":"shopee-la-cua-nuoc-nao","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-shopee\/shopee-la-cua-nuoc-nao\/","title":{"rendered":"Shopee c\u1ee7a n\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0o? L\u1ecbch s\u1eed, c\u00f4ng ty m\u1eb9 v\u00e0 m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"QwP3dgQVKoACfDxytbelThdEgQe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MnSqdF477oPvdzxEQBHlZ3Yeg9x\">Vi\u1ec7c t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u Shopee l\u00e0 c\u1ee7a n\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0o v\u00e0 m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh c\u1ee7a n\u00f3 l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y. \u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n tr\u00ean s\u00e0n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p t\u1ea1i <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OHDFdpg8XoKO9QxZNfMlVao8gcc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZrVcdOe6eojmrfxBECKl2yAVgQd\">Shopee l\u00e0 c\u1ee7a n\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0o?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QfAXd2HUboRaTAxoanHlj76Rg0g\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5624\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5624\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5624\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Shopee-la-cua-nuoc-nao.png\" alt=\"Shopee l\u00e0 c\u1ee7a n\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0o?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Shopee-la-cua-nuoc-nao.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Shopee-la-cua-nuoc-nao-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Shopee-la-cua-nuoc-nao-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Shopee-la-cua-nuoc-nao-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Shopee-la-cua-nuoc-nao-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5624\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Shopee l\u00e0 c\u1ee7a n\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0o?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pg7idCZjUoJcSPx2DbTlOii1gcg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CcmbdZkgmoCDqixQtNRlf1rigqd\">Shopee l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed \u0111a qu\u1ed1c gia ra \u0111\u1eddi t\u1ea1i Singapore v\u00e0 thu\u1ed9c t\u1eadp \u0111o\u00e0n SEA Limited (tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 Garena). N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ra m\u1eaft l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u v\u00e0o th\u00e1ng 2 n\u0103m 2015, do doanh nh\u00e2n Forrest Li s\u00e1ng l\u1eadp. Shopee ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh \u01b0u ti\u00ean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb di \u0111\u1ed9ng (mobile-first marketplace), gi\u00fap ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u1ebb.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PqIcd0heXoSybJxz488ldPgZgIc\">Hi\u1ec7n nay Shopee \u0111\u00e3 m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng sang nhi\u1ec1u qu\u1ed1c gia tr\u00ean th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 khu v\u1ef1c \u0110\u00f4ng Nam \u00c1 v\u00e0 \u0110\u00e0i Loan. Ngo\u00e0i c\u00e1c n\u01b0\u1edbc nh\u01b0 Singapore, Malaysia, Th\u00e1i Lan, Indonesia, Philippines v\u00e0 Vi\u1ec7t Nam, Shopee c\u00f2n c\u00f3 m\u1eb7t t\u1ea1i Brazil v\u00e0 Ba Lan. S\u1ef1 hi\u1ec7n di\u1ec7n n\u00e0y cho th\u1ea5y chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u h\u00f3a c\u1ee7a Shopee nh\u1eb1m chi\u1ebfm l\u0129nh nhi\u1ec1u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H3lRdX9QioiPcCxJUowlLHqrgke\">S\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u n\u0103m 2021 ghi nh\u1eadn Shopee \u0111\u1ea1t kho\u1ea3ng 343 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng t\u1ea1i \u0110\u00f4ng Nam \u00c1. Trong qu\u00fd 2 n\u0103m 2019, s\u1ed1 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng qua Shopee t\u0103ng 92,7% \u0111\u1ea1t 246,3 tri\u1ec7u, c\u00f2n gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb giao d\u1ecbch (GMV) \u0111\u1ea1t 3,8 t\u1ef7 USD, t\u0103ng 72,7% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 minh ch\u1ee9ng r\u00f5 r\u1ec7t cho t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMH1dYAb5o1MZMxYXjsl2Mv7g8d\">T\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, Shopee chi\u1ebfm kho\u1ea3ng 62% th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n b\u00e1n l\u1ebb online theo gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb giao d\u1ecbch (GMV) trong qu\u00fd 1 n\u0103m 2025, gi\u1ea3m nh\u1eb9 so v\u1edbi 68% c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc. Doanh s\u1ed1 Shopee t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n n\u00e0y v\u1eabn t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng kho\u1ea3ng 29,3% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3. Ri\u00eang h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u tr\u00ean Shopee Vi\u1ec7t Nam qu\u00fd 1\/2025 \u0111\u1ea1t doanh s\u1ed1 kho\u1ea3ng 3,6 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng v\u1edbi h\u01a1n 80 tri\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, chi\u1ebfm 5,9% th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U2PTdEr1UorQ1nxhjDMlUACbgFe\">S\u1ef1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n nhanh ch\u00f3ng c\u1ee7a Shopee \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0u ti\u00ean di \u0111\u1ed9ng, t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm tr\u00ean smartphone. N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean tung ra c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, freeship v\u00e0 m\u00e3 \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i, t\u1ea1o s\u1ee9c h\u00fat l\u1edbn \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng. Ngo\u00e0i ra, Shopee \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh Shopee \u0110\u1ea3m B\u1ea3o, gi\u1eef ti\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n cho \u0111\u1ebfn khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng, gi\u00fap n\u00e2ng cao ni\u1ec1m tin kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ECljdtoPNoUgi3xXkGllOY5ygpf\">Shopee k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh C2C v\u00e0 B2C \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 c\u1ea3 c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng nh\u1ecf l\u1ebb v\u00e0 c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y t\u1ea1o ra h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i \u0111a d\u1ea1ng, gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p t\u1eeb nhi\u1ec1u ngu\u1ed3n cung kh\u00e1c nhau. S\u1ef1 linh ho\u1ea1t trong m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh c\u0169ng l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 gi\u00fap Shopee gi\u1eef v\u1ecb th\u1ebf c\u1ea1nh tranh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DTapd5AbMotm2MxNBbHlCTbxgpX\">Tuy nhi\u00ean, Shopee \u0111ang \u0111\u1ed1i m\u1eb7t v\u1edbi c\u1ea1nh tranh gay g\u1eaft t\u1eeb TikTok Shop v\u00e0 c\u00e1c s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed kh\u00e1c. TikTok Shop \u0111\u00e3 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd, n\u00e2ng th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam t\u1eeb kho\u1ea3ng 23% l\u00ean 35% ch\u1ec9 trong qu\u00fd 1 n\u0103m 2025. \u0110\u1ec3 duy tr\u00ec v\u1ecb th\u1ebf, Shopee c\u1ea7n ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1edbi ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SxDTdLkb4oZhU7xD0cIl3LDLgQe\">Trong t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai, Shopee \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ef1 b\u00e1o s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n ph\u00e2n kh\u00fac th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 gian h\u00e0ng Shopee Mall \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng nhu c\u1ea7u ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao. N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y c\u0169ng s\u1ebd ph\u1ea3i ch\u00fa tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng nh\u1ecf v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 logistics. Nh\u1eefng b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111i n\u00e0y s\u1ebd gi\u00fap Shopee duy tr\u00ec \u0111\u00e0 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 c\u1ee7ng c\u1ed1 v\u1ecb tr\u00ed d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed khu v\u1ef1c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8kTdxJw6oQxBIxENBelZ2QNgCd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MgCHdOjYMo3ThUx1oi9lePvNg9c\">L\u1ecbch s\u1eed h\u00ecnh th\u00e0nh v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ty m\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a Shopee<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Eyf9d7VMHoPDI8xrQsWluD1bgCg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-L1nUd6ZOFoDyDYxRXUqlhbSHg2c\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;46d6f6e9-b513-4874-b72d-bc27c96a8c43&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FNUFGb5G1IoNXE0xK7fflLmfkg7e%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;NUFGb5G1IoNXE0xK7fflLmfkg7e&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1083046,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5625\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5625\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5625\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lich-su-hinh-thanh-va-cong-ty-me-cua-Shopee.png\" alt=\"L\u1ecbch s\u1eed h\u00ecnh th\u00e0nh v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ty m\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a Shopee\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lich-su-hinh-thanh-va-cong-ty-me-cua-Shopee.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lich-su-hinh-thanh-va-cong-ty-me-cua-Shopee-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lich-su-hinh-thanh-va-cong-ty-me-cua-Shopee-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lich-su-hinh-thanh-va-cong-ty-me-cua-Shopee-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Lich-su-hinh-thanh-va-cong-ty-me-cua-Shopee-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5625\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>L\u1ecbch s\u1eed h\u00ecnh th\u00e0nh v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ty m\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a Shopee<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WsQ8dRVsmoRcBVxH6T7lwU61gLc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HPztdhnbyoQafFxMzGnliGqkgCc\">Shopee l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng ty con thu\u1ed9c s\u1edf h\u1eefu c\u1ee7a <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/en.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Sea_Ltd\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sea Ltd<\/a><\/strong>, m\u1ed9t t\u1eadp \u0111o\u00e0n c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 c\u0169ng c\u00f3 tr\u1ee5 s\u1edf t\u1ea1i Singapore. Sea Ltd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u00e1ng l\u1eadp b\u1edfi t\u1ef7 ph\u00fa Forrest Li v\u00e0 l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ty m\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a nhi\u1ec1u n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng kh\u00e1c nh\u01b0 nh\u00e0 ph\u00e1t h\u00e0nh game Garena v\u00e0 v\u00ed \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed SeaMoney.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KQBldtIwPoamCKxye3alzbKMgXc\">S\u1ef1 ra \u0111\u1eddi c\u1ee7a Shopee v\u00e0o n\u0103m 2015 \u0111\u00e1nh d\u1ea5u b\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea5n s\u00e2n m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd c\u1ee7a Sea Ltd v\u00e0o l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed. M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd l\u00e0 t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng mua s\u1eafm tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn d\u1ec5 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m tr\u00ean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb di \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 cho th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0110\u00f4ng Nam \u00c1 \u0111\u1ea7y ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E9j0dqxuYoUhzcx3pAWlsPnLg2b\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-W8sFdrydvoPfvAx9kGrl724ngVg\">H\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a Shopee t\u1ea1i th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KgF8d5pTjo5OvKxmP2Xlps8Fg7d\">\u1ede ph\u1ea7n tr\u00ean, ch\u00fang ta \u0111\u00e3 bi\u1ebft Shopee l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c Th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0110i\u1ec7n t\u1eed (TM\u0110T) c\u00f3 c\u00f4ng ty m\u1eb9 l\u00e0 Sea Ltd t\u1ea1i Singapore. Trong ph\u1ea7n n\u00e0y, h\u00e3y c\u00f9ng t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u th\u00eam v\u1ec1 h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n v\u00e0 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh s\u00e0n TM\u0110T h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u Vi\u1ec7t Nam c\u1ee7a Shopee.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LhrrdJSwooHcj5xlisvloj3Jgpb\">Gia nh\u1eadp th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng th\u1ed1ng l\u0129nh<\/h3>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OhCNd4Ch4oWSd6xIpO6lCnzngSb\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5626\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5626\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5626\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Gia-nhap-thi-truong-va-nhanh-chong-thong-linh.png\" alt=\"Gia nh\u1eadp th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng th\u1ed1ng l\u0129nh\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Gia-nhap-thi-truong-va-nhanh-chong-thong-linh.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Gia-nhap-thi-truong-va-nhanh-chong-thong-linh-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Gia-nhap-thi-truong-va-nhanh-chong-thong-linh-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Gia-nhap-thi-truong-va-nhanh-chong-thong-linh-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Gia-nhap-thi-truong-va-nhanh-chong-thong-linh-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5626\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Gia nh\u1eadp th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng th\u1ed1ng l\u0129nh<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LoC2dMJ6ioKC4Sxl1l9lgMkJgrS\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1I5dvHnRo4IYhxgrxZlUjAXg6f\">Shopee l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp v\u00e0o n\u0103m 2015 b\u1edfi t\u1eadp \u0111o\u00e0n SEA Limited v\u00e0 c\u00f3 tr\u1ee5 s\u1edf ch\u00ednh t\u1ea1i Singapore. M\u1eb7c d\u00f9 \u201csinh sau \u0111\u1ebb mu\u1ed9n\u201d so v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t v\u00e0i \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7 t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, Shopee ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c gia nh\u1eadp th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e0y v\u00e0o th\u00e1ng <strong>8\/2016<\/strong>, \u0111\u00e1nh d\u1ea5u b\u01b0\u1edbc ch\u00e2n \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean trong h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh chinh ph\u1ee5c ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng Vi\u1ec7t.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ERxPdD1yFoHZKQxC3rul1Wa6g3g\">T\u1ea1i th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u1edbi ra m\u1eaft, Shopee ch\u1ecdn m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh C2C (Customer-to-Customer) \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat c\u00e1c c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng nh\u1ecf l\u1ebb, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u1eadp trung ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng di \u0111\u1ed9ng (mobile-first), t\u1ea1o l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng trong m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng s\u1ed1 h\u00f3a.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X88Jd9BQWoHwdlxhSrFlPcshgpd\">Ngay t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, Shopee \u0111\u00e3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng nhanh: v\u00e0o kho\u1ea3ng th\u00e1ng 7\/2016, \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 h\u01a1n <strong>1,8 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t t\u1ea3i<\/strong> v\u00e0 c\u00f3 <strong>h\u01a1n 3 tri\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n<\/strong>, d\u00f9 v\u1eeba m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B56adKxrsolaZnxKuthlGGHUgvC\">S\u1ef1 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 c\u1ea1nh tranh, v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i l\u1edbn c\u00f9ng freeship \u0111\u00e3 l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 Shopee thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Sff1d0fFEoXLnnxWc1ilvcIJgME\">S\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n &amp; t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng c\u1ee7a Shopee t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoS0d1M1bo7T3Jx1Kk7lndu9ggW\">Shopee kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 thu\u1eadn l\u1ee3i trong chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ee9ng minh v\u1ecb th\u1ebf d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E4pOdhINno2cqZxz7dOlkc4ugxg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn qu\u00fd III\/2023, Shopee chi\u1ebfm kho\u1ea3ng <strong>69,1%<\/strong> th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n ng\u00e0nh th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, sau khi th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n t\u1eeb m\u1ee9c ~73% gi\u1ea3m nh\u1eb9 do c\u1ea1nh tranh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BEMndKfu7oS7qLxKqrklqbmTgqe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trong qu\u00fd II\/2024, Shopee \u0111\u1ea1t GMV (t\u1ed5ng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb giao d\u1ecbch) kho\u1ea3ng <strong>62.380 t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng<\/strong>, chi\u1ebfm <strong>71,4%<\/strong> th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n trong b\u1ed1n s\u00e0n \u0111a ng\u00e0nh l\u1edbn (Shopee, TikTok Shop, Lazada, Tiki).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XQZidY8DVoExbAx7JTDlvvbagMe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trong qu\u00fd I\/2025, Shopee v\u1eabn d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u v\u1edbi t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n kho\u1ea3ng <strong>62%<\/strong>, tuy nhi\u00ean \u0111\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m so v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c ~68% c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JXSqdYsQXovm14xxjWtlgIEUgZc\">S\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh cho th\u1ea5y Shopee Vi\u1ec7t Nam n\u0103m 2022 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ea1t doanh thu g\u1ea7n <strong>11.000 t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng<\/strong>, t\u0103ng kho\u1ea3ng <strong>92,2%<\/strong> so v\u1edbi n\u0103m 2021. \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi, n\u0103m 2022 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 n\u0103m Shopee b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u c\u00f3 l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn sau thu\u1ebf d\u01b0\u01a1ng, kho\u1ea3ng <strong>3.000 t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng<\/strong>, l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean sau nhi\u1ec1u n\u0103m l\u1ed7 \u0111\u1ec3 duy tr\u00ec vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 l\u1edbn.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OoLxdT6R3oSUQ8xfWORlgwIwgvg\">Ngo\u00e0i ra, trong ng\u00e0nh b\u00e1n l\u1ebb tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn Vi\u1ec7t Nam, Shopee v\u00e0 TikTok Shop g\u1ea7n \u0111\u00e2y \u0111\u00e3 chi\u1ebfm t\u1edbi <strong>90-97%<\/strong> th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n giao d\u1ecbch (GMV) t\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u qu\u00fd, v\u1edbi Shopee v\u1eabn gi\u1eef v\u1ecb tr\u00ed \u201cvua\u201d GMV nh\u01b0ng ch\u1ecbu s\u1ee9c \u00e9p c\u1ea1nh tranh t\u1eeb TikTok Shop trong t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-URm1daRTkonPI8xHUVml20Xsgwc\">T\u1ea1i sao Shopee gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e2u v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng?<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B9TpdeQU2ovvXpxBnYLlHZVXgRh\">Shopee duy tr\u00ec v\u1ecb tr\u00ed d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 nh\u1edd kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ed1t, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n b\u1edfi li\u00ean t\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1edbi v\u00e0 th\u00edch \u1ee9ng v\u1edbi th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G9cadcFb5oPCuhx9NkTlDiT8gdh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Shopee \u0111\u00e3 nhanh ch\u00f3ng t\u00edch h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng nh\u01b0 livestream, video ng\u1eafn, feed chia s\u1ebb n\u1ed9i dung, ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 l\u1edbn theo ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5, ng\u00e0y khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i (11\/11, 12\/12,&#8230;). Nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c mua s\u1eafm k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed (shoppertainment) gi\u00fap k\u00e9o d\u00e0i th\u1eddi gian ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 t\u0103ng \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QF4KdV4oXoEAKzx3f2jlJosxgvd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u1ecd c\u0169ng r\u1ea5t ch\u00fa tr\u1ecdng tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua: ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng 15 ng\u00e0y, quy\u1ec1n h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n trong khi h\u00e0ng \u0111ang v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, freeship; \u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap gi\u1ea3m r\u1ee7i ro, t\u0103ng ni\u1ec1m tin c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng khi mua tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Eq58dsGCpo2SJAxTKhbl7YzLgye\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>V\u1ec1 ph\u00eda ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n, Shopee cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o n\u1ed9i b\u1ed9, chia s\u1ebb ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c, v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3m chi ph\u00ed \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e1c c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng nh\u1ecf c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1ec5 h\u01a1n. B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3, v\u1edbi Shopee Mall v\u00e0 gian h\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u uy t\u00edn, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng mu\u1ed1n ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1ed1t c\u00f3 n\u01a1i l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn tin c\u1eady, gi\u00fap Shopee m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng t\u1eadp kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u1ea3 ph\u00e2n kh\u00fac cao c\u1ea5p h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-OgcJdGmepoRffVxTGS7lFAp4gRe\">Nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00fap Shopee th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BhqOdjwMnoquLkxith2lkGhpgMd\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5627\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5627\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5627\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Nhung-chien-luoc-giup-Shopee-thanh-cong-tai-Viet-Nam.png\" alt=\"Nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00fap Shopee th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Nhung-chien-luoc-giup-Shopee-thanh-cong-tai-Viet-Nam.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Nhung-chien-luoc-giup-Shopee-thanh-cong-tai-Viet-Nam-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Nhung-chien-luoc-giup-Shopee-thanh-cong-tai-Viet-Nam-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Nhung-chien-luoc-giup-Shopee-thanh-cong-tai-Viet-Nam-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Nhung-chien-luoc-giup-Shopee-thanh-cong-tai-Viet-Nam-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5627\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00fap Shopee th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GA2sdMlnToxqdSx4Z30ld5BLgXc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ifgqda5CJobUwzxMO42ljQO3gAe\">Shopee \u0111\u00e3 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng m\u1ed9t lo\u1ea1t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c r\u1ea5t m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd \u0111\u1ec3 chi\u1ebfm th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n v\u00e0 c\u1ee7ng c\u1ed1 v\u1ecb tr\u00ed d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam:<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-RI6adK0nMolnYrxeLSNlKIKFgZg\"><strong>\u0110\u1ed1t ti\u1ec1n &amp; khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i<\/strong><\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DiHwdWcgJoGfpoxvtDClBtm2g5g\">Khi m\u1edbi gia nh\u1eadp, Shopee \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c \u201ctr\u1eafng doanh thu\u201d \u2013 t\u1ee9c l\u00e0 d\u1ed3n v\u00e0o ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, freeship, m\u00e3 khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i, \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, b\u1ea5t ch\u1ea5p l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn l\u00fac \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c \u00e2m.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GhF2doZSyoNjOrxbq3RlsOjAggf\">Chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch n\u00e0y di\u1ec5n ra m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd t\u1eeb n\u0103m 2016 \u0111\u1ebfn kho\u1ea3ng 2018, gi\u00fap Shopee nhanh ch\u00f3ng gia t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 ph\u1ee7 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 th\u00f3i quen mua online.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PfU2dITALo0ZOrxnjJelc8tpgah\"><strong>M\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh linh ho\u1ea1t<\/strong> Ban \u0111\u1ea7u Shopee ch\u1ee7 y\u1ebfu theo m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh C2C, sau \u0111\u00f3 chuy\u1ec3n d\u1ea7n sang m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh lai (C2C + B2C) \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n l\u1edbn, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ngu\u1ed3n h\u00e0ng ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n. Shopee c\u0169ng tri\u1ec3n khai Shopee Mall \u2013 gian h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng \u2013 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng nhu c\u1ea7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng mu\u1ed1n mua s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u uy t\u00edn.<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-Zhncdsm37oLeGexoV6VlDfm9gIs\"><strong>Chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb &amp; th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u<\/strong><\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VJJ4djG3foFsfYxO4E9luv5ugTg\">Shopee t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng\/influencers nh\u01b0 S\u01a1n T\u00f9ng M-TP, chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch TVC \u201cb\u1eaft trend\u201d, c\u00e1c mini-game, livestream, Shopee Live, Shopee Feed \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ea1nh, k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u1ebb. Vi\u1ec7c \u01b0u ti\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng qua \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng di \u0111\u1ed9ng, giao di\u1ec7n th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n c\u0169ng gi\u00fap Shopee \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0a chu\u1ed9ng h\u01a1n khi m\u1ea1ng 4G\/5G, smartphone ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-MLuxdmglIopE4LxKLZBl5EHRgGe\"><strong>Chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c logistics &amp; h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n<\/strong><\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TVusdvRGWoWpCVxy4S7lfxWpgve\">Shopee th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y giao h\u00e0ng nhanh, d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n m\u1ea1nh; h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n nh\u1ecf v\u1edbi chi ph\u00ed th\u1ea5p, kh\u00f4ng thu ph\u00ed \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n ban \u0111\u1ea7u hay hoa h\u1ed3ng th\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ec3 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch h\u1ecd tham gia. Ngo\u00e0i ra, ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch cho tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng d\u00e0i ng\u00e0y, ho\u00e0n tr\u1ea3 ti\u1ec1n\/shipping cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua khi c\u00f3 v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 \u2014 gi\u00fap t\u1ea1o l\u00f2ng tin trong giao d\u1ecbch tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L2YQdbnIAo70FwxxP9dloiAjgsd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Dkzldj02doAs8BxE0AclRib2gP0\">M\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh c\u1ee7a Shopee l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P2zXdr6HXoxPrXxcsd5lne6KgGg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-RZufd1vBfoQxrGxz4gYlk3m2gvd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f04c82c0-06db-46f7-b726-4098c482326e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FMF6AbXqsnoaDCwx5b7zl78LZgTg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;MF6AbXqsnoaDCwx5b7zl78LZgTg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:353255,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5628\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5628\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5628\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/36fffcf5-a3db-439d-8722-916309b9f836.png\" alt=\"M\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh c\u1ee7a Shopee l\u00e0 g\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/36fffcf5-a3db-439d-8722-916309b9f836.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/36fffcf5-a3db-439d-8722-916309b9f836-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/36fffcf5-a3db-439d-8722-916309b9f836-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/36fffcf5-a3db-439d-8722-916309b9f836-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/36fffcf5-a3db-439d-8722-916309b9f836-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5628\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>M\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh c\u1ee7a Shopee l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XEKCd82RHo3Kn1x7K1flxtaRg8e\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MoPqdUVSGovlSPxzLarlzKuogvf\">Shopee v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh theo m\u1ed9t m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p, ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Ajh6da8kmoZaqKx63ePlX9mLgoe\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa C2C, B2C v\u00e0 Shopee Mall<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QywKdiTRVohwn2xgHlglKEytgBf\">Ban \u0111\u1ea7u, Shopee t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh <strong>C2C (Customer-to-Customer)<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t khu ch\u1ee3 tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn n\u01a1i c\u00e1c c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m cho nhau. D\u1ea7n d\u1ea7n, n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng sang m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh <strong>B2C (Business-to-Customer)<\/strong>, cho ph\u00e9p c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ty m\u1edf gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 kinh doanh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D3uSdRDtzoRdD5xy4l3lMxAkgAc\">\u0110\u1ec9nh cao c\u1ee7a m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh B2C ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 <strong>Shopee Mall<\/strong>, m\u1ed9t kh\u00f4ng gian mua s\u1eafm cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh ri\u00eang cho c\u00e1c ch\u1ee7 s\u1edf h\u1eefu th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 nh\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng ni\u1ec1m tin c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb cao.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SUoddSOjGoe0hNxYTHrlGVZTgDh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-LZNqd4SVqoAqE8xygEYlXf5tg4f\">Ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i Shop tr\u00ean Shopee<\/h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-VTSmdXgQcort6vxfLdZlRvlpg8b\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"105\" \/>\n<col width=\"156\" \/>\n<col width=\"154\" \/>\n<col width=\"171\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Lo\u1ea1i gian h\u00e0ng<\/td>\n<td>\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u00ednh<\/td>\n<td>\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n\/N\u00e2ng c\u1ea5p<\/td>\n<td>\u0110\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shop Th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/td>\n<td>Lo\u1ea1i c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u1ea5t, d\u00e0nh cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u tr\u00ean Shopee.<\/td>\n<td>Kh\u00f4ng y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/td>\n<td>C\u01a1 b\u1ea3n, ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shop Y\u00eau Th\u00edch<\/td>\n<td>Gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, th\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f3 doanh s\u1ed1 t\u1ed1t v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 cao.<\/td>\n<td>\u0110\u1ea1t ti\u00eau ch\u00ed v\u1ec1 doanh s\u1ed1, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i chat, v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u00edch c\u1ef1c.<\/td>\n<td>Cao, t\u1ea1o l\u00f2ng tin t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shopee Mall<\/td>\n<td>Gian h\u00e0ng c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9 cao nh\u1ea5t, d\u00e0nh cho th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn ho\u1eb7c nh\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c.<\/td>\n<td>Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd ch\u1ee9ng minh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, c\u1ea7n Shopee x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t.<\/td>\n<td>R\u1ea5t cao, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee b\u1ea3o ch\u1ee9ng, th\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f3 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kz1cdv4WJoA4eFx5U00lscjzgxe\">Qua b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> \u0111\u00e3 g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn cho nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p nh\u1eefng th\u00f4ng tin h\u1eefu \u00edch v\u1ec1 Shopee, m\u1ed9t c\u00f4ng ty c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 c\u1ee7a Singapore, thu\u1ed9c s\u1edf h\u1eefu c\u1ee7a t\u1eadp \u0111o\u00e0n h\u00f9ng m\u1ea1nh Sea Ltd. Th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 v\u1eefng ch\u1eafc m\u00e0 c\u00f2n t\u1eeb chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00e2m nh\u1eadp v\u00e0 am hi\u1ec3u s\u00e2u s\u1eafc c\u00e1c th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng nh\u01b0 Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HMFYdrxX4oYRUqxw6uhlsSAKgJd\">V\u1edbi m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh \u0111a d\u1ea1ng v\u00e0 h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng, Shopee ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn s\u1ebd ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t th\u1ebf l\u1ef1c th\u1ed1ng tr\u1ecb tr\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed khu v\u1ef1c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XogodHS2hoAwvLx2ttzlLka7gvb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F0tBdWKc9ouVMkxbISmlScgIgif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1zOdpTlKoctbZx2CeclelbEgNe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLSVdBWXkoC8WCxZhallVoJrgfc\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","prote